# Worker staging artifacts. A delivery tarball is assembled, unpacked, and then
# superseded by the loose files; the tarball is a stale generation of content
# that output/ already ignores. Measured 2026-07-27: 46 of 53 files inside
# _e16-render-fidelity-delivery.tar.gz differed from their on-disk successors.
_*.tar.gz
testwrite.txt
.DS_Store

# Python bytecode. Every Python file in this repository lives under this
# directory, so the rule belongs here rather than in the root ignore file.
# CPython writes these beside any module it imports, which means simply
# RUNNING the reader leaves untracked files, and the ship script refuses on
# untracked files. Added N.59 step 1, 2026-08-16, after a cache-generation run
# blocked a ship from another session.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

